    "detailed_description": "You inherit a shopping center in the middle of the desert, an oasis for your customers crossing this hot road. Renovate it, make your own products in your expandable underground laboratory! Your Shopping Center is autonomous, manage your production of electricity, water, oil, resources.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your LABORATORY</h2>Manufacture numerous industrial machines for your personal and commercial production! Expand your underground laboratory without limits. From the mine, to the ores, to the foundry, to manufacture advanced components essential to your development! Freely place your constructions, and destroy them to better organize your space!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/b5af16907312ae243711c663d208d2c7.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up your SHOP</h2>Thanks to numerous construction plans, arrange your shop to perfection! Sell many products previously manufactured in your laboratory! Automate your payment checkouts. Improvements are available to boost your sales!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/cc9bf83f616645d3af651ea0ffd4b306.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your PARKING</h2>Build a parking lot for your customers using materials previously made in your laboratory! Equip your parking spaces with ticketing to charge your customers! Improve their comfort and earn more money!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/04f63ddb5e381401ca4bc50392202cd7.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Industrial autonomy </h2><br>You are cut off from the rest of the world! Thanks to numerous technologies, manage your production of electricity, water, oil and raw materials!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap </h2>Next updates to come: Gas station, car wash, laundromat, computer store, car garage, hotel, pets, arcade, clothing section, restaurant!",
    "about_the_game": "You inherit a shopping center in the middle of the desert, an oasis for your customers crossing this hot road. Renovate it, make your own products in your expandable underground laboratory! Your Shopping Center is autonomous, manage your production of electricity, water, oil, resources.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your LABORATORY</h2>Manufacture numerous industrial machines for your personal and commercial production! Expand your underground laboratory without limits. From the mine, to the ores, to the foundry, to manufacture advanced components essential to your development! Freely place your constructions, and destroy them to better organize your space!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/b5af16907312ae243711c663d208d2c7.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up your SHOP</h2>Thanks to numerous construction plans, arrange your shop to perfection! Sell many products previously manufactured in your laboratory! Automate your payment checkouts. Improvements are available to boost your sales!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/cc9bf83f616645d3af651ea0ffd4b306.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your PARKING</h2>Build a parking lot for your customers using materials previously made in your laboratory! Equip your parking spaces with ticketing to charge your customers! Improve their comfort and earn more money!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823890/extras/04f63ddb5e381401ca4bc50392202cd7.avif?t=1754510586\" width=600 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Industrial autonomy </h2><br>You are cut off from the rest of the world! Thanks to numerous technologies, manage your production of electricity, water, oil and raw materials!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap </h2>Next updates to come: Gas station, car wash, laundromat, computer store, car garage, hotel, pets, arcade, clothing section, restaurant!",
    "short_description": "Mine, farm, manufacture components and build a wide range of machines in an infinite basement. Forget primitive tasks thanks to automation! And sell your products to your customers! Build a parking, a gas station...",
